    "title": "Get 79% off standard costs with 'early bird' pricing of A-Basin summer pass - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Piper Russell ,\n7 hours ago Photo Credit: Lucas Herbert, Arapahoe Basin. Summer activities are about to kick off at Arapahoe Basin Ski Area, and the Summit County, Colorado resort is offering ‘early bird pricing’ pricing for its summer pass that delivers a value of $1,000 for just $209.\nThe pass includes entry into the Summer Beer Fest and Oktoberfest, one full-day Via Ferrata tour, an Aerial Adventure Park season pass with two buddy tickets, a bike pass, and unlimited summer scenic lift rides, mountain-top yoga classes, and wildflower hikes.\nA-Basin will be open for summer operations from July 2 to August 16, Thursday through Sunday. After August 16 the resort will be open Friday through Sunday until Sept. 20. The resort will also be open on Monday, Sept. 7 for Labor Day. If you plan on visiting Arapahoe Basin for activities this summer, the summer pass is the way to do it.\nFind more information about the summer season at A-Basin here .\nSTAY INFORMED: Get free Colorado news with our daily newsletter (Click here)",
    "summary": "7 hours ago Photo Credit: Lucas Herbert, Arapahoe Basin. Summer activities are about to kick off at Arapahoe Basin Ski Area, and the Summit County, Colorado resort is offering ‘early bird pricing’ pricing for its summer pass that delivers a value of $1,000 for just $209. The pass includes entry into the Summer Beer Fest and Oktoberfest, one full-day Via Ferrata tour, an Aerial Adventure Park season pass with two buddy tickets, a bike pass, and unlimited summer scenic lift rides, mountain-top yoga classes, and wildflower hikes.",
